14 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 12 0 R/T(This is about being informed and providing INFORMATION and COMMITMENT regarding my participation as a "Spotter" in the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Air Shows.)/E(This is about being informed and providing INFORMATION and COMMITMENT regarding my participation as a "Spotter" in the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Air Shows.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

15 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 44 0 R/E(I hereby declare that, following my application to participate as a "Spotter" at the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Airshows, organized by S.H.M. \215Sivrihisar Aviation Center\216 at the Necati Artan Facilities on September 19 and 20, 2026, the SHG Organizing Committee has accepted my registration as a "Spotter".)/Pg 8 0 R/K[1 2]>>
endobj

16 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 45 0 R/E(I hereby declare that I assume all legal and criminal responsibility for my use of all facilities provided to me for photography purposes at the S.H.M. \215Sivrihisar Aviation Center\216, Necati Artan Facilities, within the scope of the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Airshows, and that S.H.M. and other companies involved in the organization have no legal responsibility towards me. I also waive all my legal and compensation/damage rights, should any such rights arise.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[3 4]>>
endobj

17 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 46 0 R/E(I understand that, as a "Spotter" in this organization, I am aware of the possibility of injury and/or loss of life to myself and/or those around me due to errors in aviation operations and/or my own mistakes, and that I have been informed about potential dangers and precautions; that the SHG Organizing Committee, Sivrihisar Aviation Center, Sivrihisar Aviation Club Association, and all other organizations and/or companies providing air and ground services during the organization shall not be held liable for any ground or air accidents that may occur at S.H.M. for any reason whatsoever, and that all "legal and criminal responsibility" shall belong to me.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

18 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 47 0 R/E(\215As a spotter, I agree that the equipment I will use will be inspected by the SHG Organizing Committee, and that the suitability of this equipment for the SHG Organization to which I have applied to participate as a spotter will be decided by the Committee.\216)/Pg 8 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

19 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 48 0 R/E(I am aware that the SHG Airshow 2026 Organization, where I participated as a spotter, has set the "spotter age limit as 18 years and older," and I have no objection to the SHG Organizing Committee verifying my age.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

20 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 49 0 R/E(I acknowledge that I used the organizational area and the sections, buildings, and units within it \(toilets, hangar, parking lot, infirmary, etc.\) provided for my use throughout the organization of the event of my own free will and volition.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

21 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 50 0 R/E(I will only be taking aviation-related photos as a "spotter," and I will not be taking photos of guests in the VIP area.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

22 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 51 0 R/E(I agree not to go into areas other than those designated by the Organizing Committee, and to take photographs only in the areas indicated verbally and/or on the map.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

23 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 52 0 R/E(I hereby declare that, as a "Spotter" at SHG Airshow, I will act in accordance with the requirements of "aviation discipline," comply with national and international regulations, and adhere to all "bulletins/instructions" issued and/or to be issued by the SHG Airshow Organizing Committee.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

24 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 53 0 R/E(The publication, copyright, usage, and exhibition rights of films, photographs, and similar works produced during the organized event will belong to the SHG Airshow Organizing Committee, S.H.M., and the Sivrihisar Aviation Club Association, together with the authors of the works.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

25 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 54 0 R/E(The aforementioned works may be used by the SHG Airshow Organizing Committee, S.H.M. / Sivrihisar Aviation Club Association in books, catalogs, advertisements, brochures, websites, official social media accounts and similar printed publications, provided that the photographer's name is mentioned.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

26 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 55 0 R/E(For works used in this manner, the copyright holder shall under no circumstances subsequently revoke the permission granted and shall not prevent the work from being used in the manner described above, nor shall they make any copyright or material or moral claims for this permission/consent.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

27 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 56 0 R/E(I consent to the use of my photographs and videos taken before, during, and after flights, and by other individuals, companies, and institutions operating within S.H.M.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

28 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 57 0 R/E(I acknowledge that I am solely responsible for any damage or loss I may cause to others or the environment due to any tools, equipment, or machinery under my control during events, demonstrations, and activities at the S.H.M. Necati Artan Facilities, and that I will comply with the working rules communicated by the Organizing Committee.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

29 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 58 0 R/E(I hereby declare that I am solely responsible for any damage, loss, or damage to the vehicles, tools, and equipment under my control, including but not limited to, any damage that may occur to them due to natural disasters, adverse weather conditions, fire, terrorism, damage caused by third parties, or similar factors. Therefore, the S.H.G. Organizing Committee, the S.H.M. / Sivrihisar Aviation Club Association Management, or its personnel shall not be held liable.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

30 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 59 0 R/E(For these reasons, I accept all legal and criminal liability that may arise, and I will not make any claims for compensation whatsoever from the SHG Airshow Organizing Committee, S.H.M. / Sivrihisar Aviation Club Association Management or personnel.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

31 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 60 0 R/E(I have received the briefings given to me on the dates of the event, September 19 and 20, 2026, and I will comply with them exactly.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[5]>>
